Date: Mon, 24 Aug 2026 12:15:37 -0700
Subject: [M152][gpu] Add flush_queries_before_deleting_or_unbinding_fbo
 workaround

* Mirror workaround from ANGLE to prevent a driver
crash on ARM Mali (Avalon/Valhall) devices. The
crash is triggered when a framebuffer object is
unbound or deleted while GPU queries are still
pending.

* On `run_gl_tests`, added tests crash reliably
with `--use-gl=egl` and ANGLE workaround is
disabled.

* Tests pass when `--use-cmd-decoder=validating`
is enabled

(cherry picked from commit 41e01b272f6c8008f07af406e547a08ed7495c2f)

